{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"You answer succinctly.\n<query>\nBetty needs $100; has half; parents give $15; grandparents twice parents. How much more needed?\n<\/query>\n\n<examples>\nQ: James runs 3 sprints, 3 times a week, 60m each. How many meters per week? A: ... The answer is 540.\nQ: Brandon's iPhone age puzzle... A: ... The answer is 8.\nQ: Jean has 30 lollipops ... bags? A: ... The answer is 14.\nQ: Weng earns $12\/hour, worked 50 minutes. How much? A: ... The answer is 10.\n<\/examples>"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"chain_of_thought":{"type":"string"},"answer":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["chain_of_thought","answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}